# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Perspective alignment (yɛrɛyɛrɛli sen bɛ o la) .
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama silindrique ye
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Aw bɛ fɛn lamagalenw ka ja filanan bɔ (foto fɔlɔ ye misali ye)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Focal janya (px) / ja bonya (px) .
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Focus bɔli bɛ baara kɛ ni layɛrɛ maskw ye minnu bɛ se ka ladilan. Maskɛ dɔ sugandi Layers kɔnɔ ani ka penti kɛ walasa ka a nɔgɔya.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Labɛnni dafalen si ma Sɔrɔ. Baara kɛ ni fotow ye minnu bɛ kɛ ni sɛbɛnniw ye, ni u bɛ ɲɔgɔn dafa kosɛbɛ ani ni u yecogo caman Changements modes de voir.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Soso ja minnu tɛ tiɲɛ walima minnu bɛ fara ɲɔgɔn kan.
